OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Flate evening sunshine, then a clear
OL,7,Fnight with light winds. A little
OL,8,Fcooler for many, but likely to stay
OL,9,Fwarm for urban areas. Some patchy
OL,10,Fcloud developing by dawn with the odd
OL,11,Fspot of light rain possible.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA rather cloudy start in
OL,14,Fplaces, with perhaps an isolated light
OL,15,Fshower. Soon brightening up with
OL,16,Flengthy spells of, often hazy,
OL,17,Fsunshine developing. Feeling pleasant
OL,18,Ffor most.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
